<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan overnight rates stay low at close.</title>
<headline>Pakistan overnight rates stay low at close.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan overnight funds traded at two to four percent all day on Saturday in a liquid market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Low overnight rates pulled down one-week rates to nine percent and one-month rates to 13.75 percent, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Rates were likely to stay low till the next open market operation next week after the Sunday weekend, he said.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
